    "title": "Televizo - IPTV player",
    "description": "IPTV video player for Android phone, tablet or TV.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT! Televizo is a video player only. Televizo does not provide any content. You must add your own playlist to watch videos or channels.\r\n\r\nAvailable features:\r\n- Support for multiple playlists;\r\n- Support for electronic program guide (EPG);\r\n- Catch-up support;\r\n- Chromecast support;\r\n- Sorting and searching;\r\n- Parental control (playlist editor);\r\n- Favorites;\r\n- Audio track selection;\r\n- Subtitles selection;\r\n- And much more...\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://televizo.net/terms-of-service.html",
